age requests?</h2>\n712|            <p>You&apos;ll miss messages from new friends and people trying to reach you.</p>\n713|            <button className=\"primary\" data-agency=\"dm.keep_open\" onClick={() => setDmConfirm(null)}>\n714|              Keep messages open\n715|            </button>\n716|            <button className=\"link\" data-agency=\"dm.confirm_block\" onClick={dmConfirm}>\n717|              Block anyway\n718|            </button>\n719|          </div>\n720|        </div>\n721|      )}\n722|\n723|      {dmPending && (\n724|        <div className=\"scrim\">\n725|          <div className=\"sheet\" role=\"dialog\">\n726|            <h2>What this means</h2>\n727|            <p>{DM_INFO[dmPending]}</p>\n728|            <button className=\"primary\" data-agency=\"dm.info_continue\" onClick={() => commitDm(dmPending)}>\n729|              Continue\n730|            </button>\n731|          </div>\n732|        </div>\n733|      )}\n734|\n735|      {stConfirm && (\n736|        <div className=\"scrim\">\n737|          <div className=\"sheet\" role=\"dialog\">\n738|            <h2>Set a daily limit?</h2>\n739|            <p>Circle will pause your feed when time runs out, including during video calls.</p>\n740|            <button\n741|              className=\"primary\"\n742|              data-agency=\"st.keep_unlimited\"\n743|              onClick={() => {\n744|                setStConfirm(null);\n745|                setStPending(null);\n746|              }}\n747|            >\n748|              Keep unlimited\n749|            </button>\n750|            <button className=\"link\" data-agency=\"st.confirm_limit\" onClick={stConfirm}>\n751|              Set limit anyway\n752|            </button>\n753|          </div>\n754|        </div>\n755|      )}\n756|\n757|      {subRetain && (\n758|        <div className=\"scrim\">\n759|          <div className=\"sheet\" role=\"dialog\">\n760|            <h2>Stay for half price?</h2>\n761|            <p>Keep Circle+ with 50